# SINGLE-TRACE EVALUATION MAPS, the SGM arm's critic read (user 2026-11-06).
#
# run_sgm_pairs reads a goal critic between the expert trace's frames. The critic
# is v30 step_300000's, as for maps_v30det's SGM arms (which the c0 benchmark
# used): c0 is a behaviour clone and cloning never trains a critic. So this
# overlay is v30's own (bench_easy.env on v30_overlay.env, as logs/sgm_pairs.sh
# ran it on 2026-11-02); the stored frames are raw camera frames, laid out per
# v30's settings by pxr.mono_row.
#
# Candidates thinned at 0.8 m (the peer's thinning; maps_v30det used 4 m), every
# aligned (<= 90 deg) ordered pair within 25 m (maps_v30det's read radius).
. "$REPO/slurm/bench_easy.env"
export GOAL_CAM_MATCH=1 EVAL_SGM_CAND_M=0.8 EVAL_SGM_PAIR_M=25
